<title>USA: Flores &amp; Rucks declines comment on stock.</title>
<headline>Flores &amp; Rucks declines comment on stock.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said Monday it had requested a public statement from Flores &amp; Rucks Inc to indicate whether there were any corporate developments to explain unusual market activity in its stock.</p>
<p>The company, which is involved in oil and gas exploration and production, said that as a matter of policy it would not comment on unusual market activity or rumors.  </p>
<p>The stock was down 4-1/4 at 44 in late afternoon trading on the New York Stock Exchange.</p>
</text>
